
## API Endpoints

- `POST /scripts` - Create script
- `GET /scripts` - List scripts with filters
- `POST /scripts/{id}/execute` - Execute script
- `POST /workflows/execute` - Execute workflow with dependencies
- `POST /generate` - AI script generation
- `POST /analyze/{id}` - AI security analysis

## Security Features

- Pattern-based dangerous code detection
- Resource limits (memory, CPU, time)
- Sandboxed execution environments
- Input validation and sanitization
- AI-generated code security review
